673
00:31:49,790 --> 00:31:50,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that if something got flagged,</font></font>

674
00:31:51,160 --> 00:31:52,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'd get thrown under the bus,</font></font>

675
00:31:52,680 --> 00:31:53,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">so she had my dad</font></font>

676
00:31:53,480 --> 00:31:54,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">move me to the R&D department.</font></font>

677
00:31:54,960 --> 00:31:56,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But I don't have a STEM background.</font></font>

678
00:31:57,240 --> 00:31:58,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">They did some kind of</font></font>

679
00:31:58,160 --> 00:31:59,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">naked-eye 3D stereoscopic test.</font></font>

680
00:32:00,240 --> 00:32:01,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Made me so dizzy.</font></font>

681
00:32:01,790 --> 00:32:02,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">See, I threw up for two days,</font></font>

682
00:32:03,200 --> 00:32:04,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">took leave, and came to eat with you.</font></font>

683
00:32:07,510 --> 00:32:09,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Gotta go. I'm out.</font></font>

684
00:32:19,070 --> 00:32:19,810
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hello, baby.</font></font>

685
00:32:20,070 --> 00:32:20,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianna,</font></font>

686
00:32:20,680 --> 00:32:22,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm calling you from my watch.</font></font>

687
00:32:22,640 --> 00:32:24,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Are you being held hostage?</font></font>

688
00:32:25,440 --> 00:32:26,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Where are you?</font></font>

689
00:32:26,590 --> 00:32:27,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not being held hostage.</font></font>

690
00:32:28,000 --> 00:32:29,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I just took first place in my</font></font>

691
00:32:29,720 --> 00:32:30,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">roller skating competition.</font></font>

692
00:32:31,200 --> 00:32:32,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I video-called Dad,</font></font>

693
00:32:32,880 --> 00:32:33,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and suddenly</font></font>

694
00:32:34,270 --> 00:32:35,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I saw Heng</font></font>

695
00:32:36,110 --> 00:32:36,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">flash by in the frame.</font></font>

696
00:32:37,310 --> 00:32:37,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was afraid Dad</font></font>

697
00:32:38,000 --> 00:32:39,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">called him over to yell at him again.</font></font>

698
00:32:39,400 --> 00:32:40,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I got in the car</font></font>

699
00:32:40,510 --> 00:32:41,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and rushed to give you a heads-up.</font></font>

700
00:32:42,350 --> 00:32:43,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dad's at the equestrian center.</font></font>

701
00:32:43,350 --> 00:32:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Hurry over and check!</font></font>

702
00:32:44,920 --> 00:32:45,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Heng?</font></font>

703
00:32:59,160 --> 00:33:01,290
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dad, you've gone too far.</font></font>

704
00:33:02,030 --> 00:33:03,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhao Heng is just my boyfriend.</font></font>

705
00:33:03,200 --> 00:33:04,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's not your employee.</font></font>

706
00:33:04,590 --> 00:33:05,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is there something so huge</font></font>

707
00:33:05,830 --> 00:33:06,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">that you had to</font></font>

708
00:33:06,830 --> 00:33:07,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">call him all the way here</font></font>

709
00:33:07,640 --> 00:33:08,660
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to talk to him alone?</font></font>

710
00:33:09,400 --> 00:33:09,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Well,</font></font>

711
00:33:10,400 --> 00:33:11,330
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you should ask him yourself.</font></font>

712
00:33:14,030 --> 00:33:14,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianna.</font></font>

713
00:33:15,680 --> 00:33:16,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Actually,</font></font>

714
00:33:16,880 --> 00:33:18,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I came to see Mr. Bu on my own.</font></font>

715
00:33:23,000 --> 00:33:23,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why?</font></font>

716
00:33:27,920 --> 00:33:28,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Here's the thing.</font></font>

717
00:33:29,440 --> 00:33:29,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm on a break</font></font>

718
00:33:29,920 --> 00:33:31,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">after wrapping up the project.</font></font>

719
00:33:31,440 --> 00:33:32,620
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I wanted to use Maxmise's database,</font></font>

720
00:33:32,680 --> 00:33:33,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">my analysis</font></font>

721
00:33:33,030 --> 00:33:34,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">of Siwei Group,</font></font>

722
00:33:34,550 --> 00:33:36,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and my understanding and observations of you</font></font>

723
00:33:36,640 --> 00:33:37,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to put together</font></font>

724
00:33:37,830 --> 00:33:38,770
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a small business plan</font></font>

725
00:33:39,350 --> 00:33:40,250
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and succession analysis</font></font>

726
00:33:40,270 --> 00:33:40,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">for Mr. Bu.</font></font>

727
00:33:41,680 --> 00:33:42,730
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Your observations of me?</font></font>

728
00:33:45,000 --> 00:33:45,700
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So you're saying</font></font>

729
00:33:46,680 --> 00:33:47,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you talked to my dad</font></font>

730
00:33:48,880 --> 00:33:50,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">about my future</font></font>

731
00:33:50,920 --> 00:33:52,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">at our own company</font></font>

732
00:33:52,510 --> 00:33:54,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">without my permission.</font></font>

733
00:33:54,790 --> 00:33:55,220
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that right?</font></font>

734
00:33:58,310 --> 00:33:59,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You could see it that way.</font></font>

735
00:34:00,030 --> 00:34:00,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianna,</font></font>

736
00:34:02,070 --> 00:34:03,180
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you and Mr. Bu definitely know Siwei Group</font></font>

737
00:34:03,200 --> 00:34:04,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">better than I do.</font></font>

738
00:34:04,640 --> 00:34:05,140
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But look,</font></font>

739
00:34:05,240 --> 00:34:05,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">ever since you went back to Siwei Group</font></font>

740
00:34:05,920 --> 00:34:06,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">a month ago,</font></font>

741
00:34:06,440 --> 00:34:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you haven't been in a good place.</font></font>

742
00:34:08,000 --> 00:34:09,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've even been a little down.</font></font>

743
00:34:09,880 --> 00:34:10,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">So I figured</font></font>

744
00:34:11,190 --> 00:34:11,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">sometimes</font></font>

745
00:34:11,630 --> 00:34:12,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I can observe and analyze</font></font>

746
00:34:12,960 --> 00:34:13,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from a third-party perspective,</font></font>

747
00:34:14,230 --> 00:34:15,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">which is better and more objective...</font></font>

748
00:34:15,400 --> 00:34:16,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get lost right now.</font></font>

749
00:34:18,960 --> 00:34:19,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Get out!</font></font>

750
00:34:32,190 --> 00:34:32,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Mr. Bu,</font></font>

751
00:34:33,710 --> 00:34:34,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'll leave the USB drive here for you.</font></font>

752
00:34:34,920 --> 00:34:35,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You can use it as a reference.</font></font>

753
00:34:52,150 --> 00:34:54,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Dad, I hope</font></font>

754
00:34:55,840 --> 00:34:57,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you can show me a little more respect</font></font>

755
00:34:57,190 --> 00:34:58,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">from now on.</font></font>

756
00:34:58,440 --> 00:34:59,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's an outsider. You...</font></font>

757
00:35:00,000 --> 00:35:00,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you thought about</font></font>

758
00:35:01,070 --> 00:35:03,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">what an outsider gets</font></font>

759
00:35:04,880 --> 00:35:05,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">out of doing this?</font></font>

760
00:35:05,920 --> 00:35:07,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's just trying to butter you up.</font></font>

761
00:35:07,320 --> 00:35:09,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He already admitted he loves you and loves the benefits.</font></font>

762
00:35:09,550 --> 00:35:11,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What's wrong with buttering up his future father-in-law?</font></font>

763
00:35:14,110 --> 00:35:15,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He... he can't just go over my head like that.</font></font>

764
00:35:16,920 --> 00:35:17,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You think</font></font>

765
00:35:18,070 --> 00:35:19,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he could keep it a secret that he came</font></font>

766
00:35:19,920 --> 00:35:20,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">to see me privately?</font></font>

767
00:35:22,670 --> 00:35:23,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Na,</font></font>

768
00:35:24,070 --> 00:35:25,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you work at the company now.</font></font>

769
00:35:26,510 --> 00:35:28,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">He's an outsider.</font></font>

770
00:35:30,670 --> 00:35:31,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Since you wanna take over,</font></font>

771
00:35:32,800 --> 00:35:33,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I suggest you</font></font>

772
00:35:33,960 --> 00:35:35,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">calm down</font></font>

773
00:35:35,590 --> 00:35:36,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and really think this through.</font></font>

774
00:35:36,800 --> 00:35:37,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Why would he</font></font>

775
00:35:38,150 --> 00:35:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">come to me privately</font></font>

776
00:35:40,190 --> 00:35:41,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">knowing it'd make you angry?</font></font>

777
00:35:42,190 --> 00:35:43,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">And why is he</font></font>

778
00:35:43,760 --> 00:35:44,490
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">sticking his nose</font></font>

779
00:35:44,550 --> 00:35:45,820
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">into Siwei Group's internal affairs this early?</font></font>

780
00:35:46,190 --> 00:35:47,300
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't he afraid of crossing me?</font></font>

781
00:35:48,190 --> 00:35:49,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Isn't he worried you'd be mad?</font></font>

782
00:35:52,360 --> 00:35:52,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Maybe</font></font>

783
00:35:54,440 --> 00:35:55,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">he just</font></font>

784
00:35:56,320 --> 00:35:57,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">genuinely wants to help you with something.</font></font>

785
00:36:04,320 --> 00:36:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Honestly,</font></font>

786
00:36:05,320 --> 00:36:06,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I still don't like</font></font>

787
00:36:07,360 --> 00:36:08,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">this kid.</font></font>

788
00:36:09,590 --> 00:36:10,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Too calculating.</font></font>

789
00:36:11,030 --> 00:36:12,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But even so,</font></font>

790
00:36:13,280 --> 00:36:14,210
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I have to admit</font></font>

791
00:36:14,800 --> 00:36:15,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">this proposal of his</font></font>

792
00:36:16,400 --> 00:36:17,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">is pretty good.</font></font>

793
00:36:18,960 --> 00:36:20,690
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">A lot of thought went into it. Take a look.</font></font>

794
00:37:11,360 --> 00:37:11,610
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Zhao Heng,</font></font>

795
00:37:11,630 --> 00:37:12,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">do you know what I hate most?</font></font>

796
00:37:14,670 --> 00:37:16,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">It's when the person I trust most</font></font>

797
00:37:16,360 --> 00:37:17,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">goes behind my back</font></font>

798
00:37:17,320 --> 00:37:18,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and makes decisions for me.</font></font>

799
00:37:18,670 --> 00:37:19,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Who do you think you are?</font></font>

800
00:37:21,840 --> 00:37:22,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Yes.</font></font>

801
00:37:23,360 --> 00:37:24,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Right now you're my boyfriend.</font></font>

802
00:37:25,070 --> 00:37:25,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But so what?</font></font>

803
00:37:33,760 --> 00:37:34,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Tianna,</font></font>

804
00:37:35,880 --> 00:37:37,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">when you left Maxmise,</font></font>

805
00:37:37,920 --> 00:37:39,130
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">didn't you hand in your resignation letter</font></font>

806
00:37:39,150 --> 00:37:39,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">before you even told me?</font></font>

807
00:37:40,510 --> 00:37:40,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">No...</font></font>

808
00:37:41,150 --> 00:37:42,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">What I mean is,</font></font>

809
00:37:42,710 --> 00:37:43,860
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">if we weren't together,</font></font>

810
00:37:45,110 --> 00:37:46,170
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">doing that would've been totally fine.</font></font>

811
00:37:47,510 --> 00:37:48,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But we are together.</font></font>

812
00:37:49,110 --> 00:37:49,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I was</font></font>

813
00:37:49,440 --> 00:37:50,530
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">already your boyfriend then.</font></font>

814
00:37:53,000 --> 00:37:53,650
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Is that why</font></font>

815
00:37:53,670 --> 00:37:54,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you decided to get back at me?</font></font>

816
00:37:56,630 --> 00:37:57,900
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You've got some nerve.</font></font>

817
00:37:58,280 --> 00:37:59,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Have you been binging those</font></font>

818
00:37:59,400 --> 00:38:00,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">kept-husband stories?</font></font>

819
00:38:00,400 --> 00:38:01,010
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">If I were to break up</font></font>

820
00:38:01,030 --> 00:38:02,090
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with you right now, you'd be...</font></font>

821
00:38:02,590 --> 00:38:03,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">you'd be a complete nobody.</font></font>

822
00:38:04,070 --> 00:38:04,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm still me.</font></font>

823
00:38:06,670 --> 00:38:07,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Even if we break up, I'm still me.</font></font>

824
00:38:08,660 --> 00:38:11,580
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪Hey, long time no see♪</font></font>

825
00:38:11,590 --> 00:38:12,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">Anyway, I came here today</font></font>

826
00:38:12,840 --> 00:38:13,420
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">prepared to end things</font></font>

827
00:38:13,480 --> 00:38:14,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">with you.</font></font>

828
00:38:14,860 --> 00:38:16,460
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">♪You don't seem to have changed at all♪</font></font>

829
00:38:17,510 --> 00:38:18,260
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">You're threatening me?</font></font>

830
00:38:18,510 --> 00:38:19,570
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm not.</font></font>

831
00:38:22,150 --> 00:38:22,980
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm trying to survive.</font></font>

832
00:38:26,760 --> 00:38:27,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I know</font></font>

833
00:38:28,030 --> 00:38:29,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I'm a schemer.</font></font>

834
00:38:30,710 --> 00:38:31,780
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I wanted to climb the ladder</font></font>

835
00:38:31,800 --> 00:38:32,380
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">through connections.</font></font>

836
00:38:33,590 --> 00:38:34,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">But when we</font></font>

837
00:38:34,070 --> 00:38:35,050
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">actually got together</font></font>

838
00:38:35,840 --> 00:38:36,940
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and even went through a month of fighting</font></font>

839
00:38:36,960 --> 00:38:37,740
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">and the cold shoulder,</font></font>

840
00:38:39,190 --> 00:38:40,340
<font face="Noto Sans S Chinese Regular"><font size="22">I realized I really love you.</font></font>

841
